      "id": "claim_3161f57f9e3044309c9b4373865a42e2",
      "statement": "The verification loop is ordered `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` → `pnpm lint` → `pnpm test`, cheapest signal first, and has no npm script for typecheck on purpose so typecheck reads as a step in a sequence rather than a product command; CI mirrors that order so a boundary breach or an enum the mapper forgot cannot merge.",
